# Which design to build.
#
#   stack  the dark glass-and-etching design (default)
#   depth  a descent: a cinematic opening, a scroll that falls through
#          strata, a world built out of the skills, and a core
#
# The value is read at build time and decides which design's code, stylesheet
# and webfonts are bundled. Anything unrecognised falls back to `stack`.
#
# Run one directly without a .env file:
#   npm run dev          the dark design, on port 5000
#   npm run dev:depth    the depth design, on port 5001
NEXT_PUBLIC_DESIGN=stack
